, of hearing the second playful read, is what makes you quick on your feet in any room. It's the difference between the guy who freezes on a loaded comment and the guy who flips it and gets the laugh. So here's the drill. A few minutes a day, put on any show, wait for a line with an I, a you, or a we, and misread it as her being into you. Take the best possible meaning, keep it short, commit, and never explain it. Do that enough, and it stops being something you reach for. It becomes second nature. So put in the reps. That's how you stop being the one chasing and become the one she's chasing.",
